.TH NN-TARGET 1 "2026" "nn 0.1.0" "NN Manual"
.SH NAME
nn-target \- deployability against a hardware profile
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B nn target [options] <model>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Compare estimated RAM/compute against a built-in or JSON target profile.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-target NAME
Built-in target name.
.TP
.B \-\-target\-file FILE
JSON target description.
.TP
.B \-\-accelerator FILE
JSON accelerator description.
.SH EXIT STATUS
0 fits; 1 does not fit.
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
nn target model.onnx --target cortex-m4f
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
nn-targets(1), nn-memory(1)
